+**D86/D88 generated conversation only · November 4, 2026:** Owner: “skip over all prewritten blocks of writing.” In :8893, conversational explanations come from the selected model. Stop inserting prepared lessons, guide blocks, failure fallback lessons, automatic date/milestone narration, greetings and saved-resume prose. Keep source links, opening/intake questions, forms, essential status/privacy copy and explicit review/preparation tools. Topic controls stage an editable question for deliberate Send instead of opening a prepared lesson. Keep the learning curriculum, reports, factual evidence and validation available internally; omitted blocks receive no new teaching credit. Remove guide-display instructions and guide definitions from composition context. This supersedes earlier requirements to insert those blocks in this conversation only; preserve their source/archive files and protected variants. Preserve the visual shell, permission/budget boundaries and owner-led conversational review. No agent-run model conversations or paid probes. [Implementation and activation](../../audit-evidence/generated-conversation-only-20261104/README.md).
 
